# Weapons Manufacturing: a nontoken artifact entering under its controller's control makes a Munitions token; when that token
# leaves the battlefield (sacrificed to Deadly Dispute here) it deals 2 damage to any target (Bot2's face). Deadly Dispute's
# Treasure is an artifact token, and the Munitions token is one too: neither makes another Munitions. Mox Jet is cast after
# Weapons Manufacturing, so exactly one Munitions exists before the sacrifice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Weapons Manufacturing
Deadly Dispute
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

